,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974386378,"data":"# Custom validation of current leading algorithms —10November2026\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974444276,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974448335,"data":"Implements the user's accepted proposals1/2/3. Canonical policy:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974451886,"data":"../VALIDATION_PROTOCOL.md. Split seed20261110,chronology byrun/onset.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974455348,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974458508,"data":"Freeze model recipes before new8/2 scores. Compare:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974462013,"data":"- Lag4 LR50,raw and causal balance1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974465252999998,"data":"- Lag4 nuclear logistic tau.01/.05,raw and balance1,shared matched geometry.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974468633,"data":"- mSSA rank8/mix25%→Lag4 LR50,raw and balance1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974471987,"data":"- Full pre-normalization ensemble(the old62.72% recipe).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974475372,"data":"- Full point mean/std normalization ensemble(the old63.23% recipe).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974478637,"data":"- Full early+late normalization30%branch(the old64.58% recipe).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.97448194,"data":"- The same with seed-agreement branch weight(the old64.51% recipe).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974485693,"data":"- Native two-seed neural components retained as diagnostics.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974489247,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.97449237,"data":"The historical percentages name recipes,not predictions on the new folds.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974508768,"data":"No weak HOPLS/Tucker/iTransformer sweep. No new CNN architecture or tuning.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974513329,"data":"CPU forests are trained locally;60GPU outer fits retrain3existing neural\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.97451762,"data":"families ×2seeds ×10pairs,each with inner stopping and8person refit. Original\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974521822,"data":"training policies are retained for each family. Only source statistics are\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974525347,"data":"fitted; input alignment remains causal at target. Curves/checkpoints saved.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974528695,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974531818,"data":"Full model recipes:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974534995,"data":"q0=causal_TTA(.7*Lag4+.3*mean_seed_softmax(SWAD_logits/4)),soft50/half,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974538403,"data":"Lag4running geometry,k20,shrink.5,warm20,beta1,5iterations.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974541644,"data":"q1=.8*q0+.2*balance(mean_seed_softmax(point_meanstd_logits)).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974544972,"data":"q2=.7*q1+.3*balance(mean_seed_softmax(early_filter_logits)).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974548691,"data":"qgate=(1-a)*q1+a*balance(mean_seed_softmax(early_filter_logits)),\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974552451,"data":"a=.1+.2*exp(-JS(seed0,seed1)/.05). No label fit for gating.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.97455622,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974559978,"data":"Every outer pair's source priors,PCA/TTA source means and class heads must\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974563942,"data":"be rebuilt from the8source people. Reusing9person LOSO weights could leak\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974567129,"data":"the second held-out person and is not allowed. Pure perwindow covariance\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974570568,"data":"caches may be reused. Do not select seeds or branches on outer labels.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974573854,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974576986,"data":"LOSO rescoring is read-only on saved forecasts;8/2 is new model training.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.97458047,"data":"First-session BA uses mean of per-context3class balanced accuracies; every\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974585475,"data":"person equal. Stream-bin BA is3class macro recall over each bin regardless\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974589672,"data":"of context;class and context counts accompany it. It is a different slice,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.97459355,"data":"not a guaranteed monotonic learning curve. Missing-class bins areNaN,not\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974601493,"data":"silently interpreted as failure. State was generated on the whole natural\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974605186,"data":"prefix and is never restarted for a metric bin.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974608927,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974612422,"data":"Two outer appearances per person are averaged as metrics,not probabilities.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974616367,"data":"Only models with all10folds/10people/2appearances enter the pair ranking.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974620437,"data":"All-session official-style BA,worst3first-session BA,NLL and source-repeat\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974624816,"data":"spread are additional columns;no arbitrary weighted synthetic score.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974650273,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974654137,"data":"No baseline equality/commit/hash/reproduction checks,external submissions\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974658199,"data":"or background Kaggle watcher. CPU results feed the private GPU notebook;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974662265,"data":"the old9person LOSO reference forecasts are never used in its8/2 fusion.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.974665943,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":24.975388566,"data":"Only new8person classical priors included; no9person weights or old LOSO forecasts.\n"}
